<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2503>  have intended to complete other broken lines, such as II. iii. 26 l. 9;
<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2504>  II. viii. 55 l. 9.
<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2505>  III. vi. 39 l. 1. _1611_ reads ‘and all’, to avoid the trisyllabic foot.
