<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2510>  III. vii. 9 l. 3. two] to _conj. Hughes_. Morris reports ‘to’ from
<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2511>  _1596_: not so in copies examined. See also I. vi. 47 l. 8 and note there.
<Spenser F.Q. 6.12.2512>  III. vii. 13 l. 6. had] hath _1590_. The notes of Todd and Morris imply
